commit ec924032f3b3167fd97c51e8b15af73a59c011f6
Author: alialqrinqwi <alialqrinawi2@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Aug 12 12:54:37 2026 +0300

    feat: menu PDF upload with permanent URL and QR code with logo
    
    Admin endpoints upload/replace/delete a single menu PDF, served from a
    stable public /menu/pdf URL so printed QR codes keep resolving across
    re-uploads. /menu/qr and /menu/qr/download render the code on demand
    with the brand logo punched into the centre.
    
    Uses endroid/qr-code rather than simple-qrcode: the latter needs the
    imagick extension for PNG output and logo merging, which is not
    available here, while endroid renders through GD.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

